      "side": 1,
      "message": "The implementation of the new `SkPDFStructTree::Mark::structType` and the existing `SkPDFStructElem::emitStructElem` need to agree on the structure type. This is a required field and must be a name (like `/Name`) so cannot be empty. Previously we just let this be empty and the one real user (`emitStructElem`) would emit `NonStruct` on empty. Instead of spreading out a bunch of logic to keep things in sync, just use `NonStruct` here instead and don\u0027t allow `fStructType` to be the empty string. To avoid having lots of copies of this `NonStruct` string in memory just hold onto one so that all the SkString copies point at the same data under the hood (since SkString is copy on write).",
